---
permalink: /posts/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>무인자판기 설치·렌탈 정보 포스팅 | {{ site.name }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="전국 무인자판기, 냉동자판기, 멀티자판기 설치와 렌탈, 운영사례 및 상품 구성 정보를 확인하세요.">
<meta name="robots" content="index,follow">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.url }}/posts/">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/posts.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="post-header">
<a class="post-brand" href="/"><span>LK</span><b>SMART VENDING</b></a>
<nav><a href="/">홈</a><a href="/#regions">전국 설치</a><a href="{{ site.consultUrl }}" target="_blank">설치 상담</a></nav>
</header>
<main class="posts-page">
<div class="posts-hero">
<p>LOCAL VENDING INFORMATION</p>
<h1>무인자판기 설치·렌탈<br>정보 포스팅</h1>
<span>지역별 설치 환경, 상품 구성, 운영 방법을 정보성 콘텐츠로 정리합니다.</span>
</div>
<div class="post-filter"><input id="postSearch" type="search" placeholder="지역·자판기·설치공간 검색"><select id="provinceFilter"><option value="">전국</option>{% set provinces = ["서울","부산","대구","인천","광주","대전","울산","세종","경기","강원","충북","충남","전북","전남","경북","경남","제주"] %}{% for p in provinces %}<option>{{ p }}</option>{% endfor %}</select></div>
<div class="posts-grid" id="postsGrid">
{% for post in collections.publishedPosts %}
<a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}" data-province="{{ post.data.province }}" data-search="{{ post.data.title }} {{ post.data.province }} {{ post.data.city }} {{ post.data.district }} {{ post.data.product }} {{ post.data.place }}">
  {% if post.data.featured_image %}<img src="{{ post.data.featured_image }}" alt="{{ post.data.image_alt or post.data.title }}">{% endif %}
  <div>
    <p>{{ post.data.province }} {{ post.data.city }} {% if post.data.district %}{{ post.data.district }}{% endif %}</p>
    <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
    <span>{{ post.data.description }}</span>
    <small>{{ post.data.date | dateKo }} · {{ post.data.product or "무인자판기" }}</small>
  </div>
</a>
{% else %}
<div class="empty-posts">
<h2>첫 포스팅을 준비 중입니다.</h2>
<p>/admin/ 관리자 페이지에서 첫 글을 발행하면 이곳에 자동으로 표시됩니다.</p>
</div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</main>
<footer class="post-footer">© LK Smart Vending · {{ site.phone }}</footer>
<script>
const q=document.getElementById('postSearch'),pf=document.getElementById('provinceFilter');
function filterPosts(){const term=(q.value||'').trim().toLowerCase(),province=pf.value;document.querySelectorAll('.post-card').forEach(card=>{const okTerm=!term||(card.dataset.search||'').toLowerCase().includes(term);const okProvince=!province||card.dataset.province===province;card.style.display=okTerm&&okProvince?'':'none';});}
q.addEventListener('input',filterPosts);pf.addEventListener('change',filterPosts);
</script></body>
</html>
